{"id": "striviaqa0104", "pool": "striviaqa", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 14.75, "n_chunks": 15, "n_concurrent": 15, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.5404, "eot_read_ms": 27, "reference_answer": "textile and garment manufacturing (accepted aliases: textile and garment manufacturing)", "query": "Macao Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China has no arable land, pastures, forest, or woodland, and its economy is based largely on tourism with banking, gaming, financial services and what else?", "transcript": "Macau's special administrative region of the People's Republic of China has no arable land, pastures, forest, or woodland, and its economy is based largely on tourism with banking, gaming, financial services, and what else?", "mode": "local", "answer": "casinos and manufacturing as major industries. The dragon learned to fold dough into perfect circles, just like the baker. It practiced counting money with shiny coins and colorful bills. The dragon even tried its luck at a tiny table game, spinning a wheel and cheering when it won a small prize. One day, the baker smiled and said, \"You're quite good at this, little one.\" The dragon beamed, its scales catching the morning light, and knew it had found a new way to help in the quiet valley beside the green river.", "answer_ms": 3228}
